1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:05,600
Welcome to Alder Board.
Let's set up a launch board for your team.

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:10,390
From the workspace, select New board
to start with an empty board.

3
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:15,790
Name the board Product Launch,
then choose Create board.

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:22,120
Your board opens with three columns.
Add a card to the To do column.

5
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:28,580
Type Review landing page.
Then move the card into In progress.

6
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:33,570
To bring in a teammate, open
Invite members at the top of the board.

7
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,180
Enter their email address and
choose Editor so they can update cards.

8
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,900
Review the role before
you send the invite.

9
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:49,370
Open Share board to copy
the board link for your launch notes.

10
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:57,330
Your launch board is ready. You can return
here to track the team's next steps.
